  "post_content": "<p>(56 fotos) El alumnado del Centro Ocupacional El Mol&iacute; ha pasado la ma&ntilde;ana de este viernes en el local de la asociaci&oacute;n de grupos de m&uacute;sica rock Rellamp, en la nave 7 de la calle San Fernando.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/IMG_7646.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Tras un suculento almuerzo, un cuarteto musical ha interpretado en directo una canci&oacute;n de Loquillo. Despu&eacute;s han poido bailar al ritmo de m&uacute;sica variada e incluso cantar en el karaoke.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/coelmolirellamp/img_7632.jpg\" alt=\"img_7632\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/coelmolirellamp/img_7634.jpg\" alt=\"img_7634\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/coelmolirellamp/img_7637.jpg\" alt=\"img_7637\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/coelmolirellamp/img_7639.jpg\" alt=\"img_7639\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/coelmolirellamp/img_7640.jpg\" alt=\"img_7640\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/coelmolirellamp/img_7644.jpg\" alt=\"img_7644\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/coelmolirellamp/img_7646.jpg\" alt=\"img_7646\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/coelmolirellamp/img_7648.jpg\" alt=\"img_7648\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/coelmolirellamp/img_7649.jpg\" alt=\"img_